WEBVTT

00:08.880 --> 00:14.800
This northern expedition our goal is to retake Beiyu Pass to further expand the war.

00:14.880 --> 00:19.560
And prepare to recover the realm if we can take this place advancing.

00:19.640 --> 00:26.080
We can follow the Hanshui upstream straight to Guanzhong retreating we can block the Luoshui.

00:26.160 --> 00:31.560
To cut off enemy reinforcements consolidate several key towns north of Tianhe in ten days.

00:31.640 --> 00:38.120
I will lead the main force cross the Tianhe and go north enter Shuoyang first take Xingyang then attack Beiyu Pass.

00:38.600 --> 00:40.800
General Zhenglu Zu Yue, receive orders.

00:42.360 --> 00:48.680
Your general is here I order you to lead one army from Qigong Mountain attack Chen and Qiao counties.

00:48.760 --> 00:54.760
Sweep the surrounding Wutu tribes and northern rebels to pin down the Wutu Zhao main force.

00:54.840 --> 00:58.240
Your general accepts the order General Pingbei Sikong Yao.

01:01.640 --> 01:07.147
Your general is here I order you to lead one army from Ling Province northward enter and garrison Yiyang City.

